&lt;p&gt;Customers include Coca-Cola, Nestlé, Colgate-Palmolive, Mondelez, Samsung, and Kellogg&#39;s. Backed by SoftBank, Insight Partners, and Madrona. Headquartered in Mountain View with teams across the US, India, Canada, and the UK. Pre-IPO.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a BDR/SDR supporting our &lt;strong&gt;GTM for Agentic Products&lt;/strong&gt; team, you will play a critical role in helping CommerceIQ build pipeline and create new relationships with prospective customers and strategic partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for identifying and engaging the right decision-makers, developing creative outbound strategies, and generating qualified opportunities for our GTM team. This role is ideal for someone who is energized by building something new, enjoys experimenting with different approaches, and wants to develop a strong foundation for a career in sales, partnerships, or go-to-market leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who doesn&#39;t just want to follow a playbook — but wants to help build one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and engage senior-level decision-makers across target accounts through a combination of email, phone, LinkedIn, events, and other creative outbound channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research target companies, industries, and key stakeholders to develop highly personalized and relevant outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate qualified meetings and pipeline for the GTM team focused on CommerceIQ&#39;s Agentic Products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Account Executives, GTM leaders, Product, and Marketing to develop and refine outbound strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become knowledgeable about CommerceIQ&#39;s Agentic Products, AI capabilities, and the evolving commerce and retail technology landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with messaging, outreach strategies, and new prospecting approaches to continuously improve conversion and pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools and technologies to improve prospect research, personalization, productivity, and outreach effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate prospect and activity information within CRM and other GTM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share market feedback, customer insights, and objections with the broader GTM and Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build and scale the outbound motion as CommerceIQ continues to bring innovative AI products to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3+ years of experience in Business Development, Sales Development, Inside Sales, or a related customer-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience prospecting into mid-market and enterprise organizations is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in AI, technology, ecommerce, retail media, SaaS, or emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with the ability to create compelling, personalized outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally curious with strong research and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging senior-level executives and business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated, resilient, and comfortable with ambiguity and a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of ownership and a willingness to experiment, learn, and improve quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using sales and prospecting tools such as LinkedIn Sales Navigator, CRM platforms, sequencing tools, and AI-powered productivity tools is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively in an in-office, highly cross-functional environment in Mountain View, CA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling or prospecting into ecommerce, retail, CPG, retail media, or technology organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a startup or high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience using AI tools to improve sales productivity, research, messaging, or prospecting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder mentality with the ability to thrive in a zero-to-one environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A desire to grow into an Account Executive, Partnerships, GTM, or other customer-facing leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status or any other category prohibited by applicable law.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Neo4j:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is the graph intelligence platform that transforms data into knowledge to power the next generation of intelligent applications and AI systems. It includes enterprise-ready knowledge graphs for accurate, explainable, and governed AI; the most comprehensive, trusted, and easy-to-deploy graph capabilities across any environment and data source; and an unmatched ecosystem trusted by 84 of the Fortune 100 and supported by the world’s largest graph community.&amp;nbsp;Intelligence that works. Results that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built to work everywhere and integrate with everything across every cloud for dynamic, personalized, and autonomous AI systems. We deliver quicker results, contextual knowledge, and solutions that impact customers and employees across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Neo4j, we have always strived to help the world make sense of data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As business, society and knowledge become increasingly connected, our technology promotes innovation by helping organizations to find and understand data relationships. We created, drive and lead the graph database category, and we’re disrupting how organizations leverage their data to innovate and stay competitive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are aiming to hire someone in the the UK, Czechia or&amp;nbsp;Italy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Product Engineering at GraphAware offers a unique opportunity to build real-world intelligence systems that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build with purpose:&lt;/strong&gt; Your code will help law enforcement and analysts save lives and protect communities through better data insight.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with knowledge graphs, workflow engines, LLMs, and graph-native UIs pushing the boundaries of data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the future: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to product direction and technical vision alongside a senior engineering team.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;True autonomy: &lt;/strong&gt;Own your work, from ideation to deployment.Global mindset: Collaborate with a world-class team of engineers, data scientists, and product thinkers across Europe and beyond.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth without bureaucracy: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop your skills in a non-micromanaged, excellence-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Tech Lead, you will own core parts of the platform layer of GraphAware Hume, our graph-powered analytics platform — the foundations that cut across every development group and that every feature team builds on. You&#39;ll be sought out across the organisation for technical guidance on graph architecture, and expected to anticipate issues at the product level before they surface. Neo4j sits at the heart of the product, we need someone who goes beyond using it well, and actively tracks new features, tests them against real workloads, and identifies where they can move the product forward. Working hands-on with Neo4j at the heart of the product, you will drive the architecture that lets us model, query, and scale the knowledge graphs our users depend on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving platform architecture, setting technical direction for the transversal foundations that feature teams across Hume build on, and shaping cross-cutting design decisions with the wider engineering group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning our Neo4j strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: actively tracking and hands-on testing of new releases and ecosystem tooling (GDS, APOC, etc.) to assess breaking changes, propose new product opportunities, and plan deliberate, scalable migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimizing Cypher queries and graph access patterns&lt;/strong&gt; for latency, throughput, and scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentoring engineers&lt;/strong&gt; and raising the team&#39;s technical bar (especially in Neo4j), without formal management authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Partner closely with Product Managers:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; to translate long-term product goals into scalable technical roadmaps&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing secure, scalable access control systems for mission-critical environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building APIs&lt;/strong&gt; for intuitive user interaction with complex data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrating workflows to automate graph analytics, inference, and real-time insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you must know already and be excited to grow further&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep, hands-on Neo4j expertise,&lt;/strong&gt; including advanced Cypher query performance optimization, profiling, and deep familiarity with the broader Neo4j ecosystem (e.g., GDS, APOC, drivers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modelled real domains as property graphs&lt;/strong&gt; and can reason about nodes, relationships, labels, and properties as a first-class design activity (relational modelling with e.g. PostgreSQL is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track record of leading architecture and&amp;nbsp; technical direction&lt;/strong&gt; for a team or product area, not just contributing to decisions made by others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to drive consensus:&lt;/strong&gt; across engineering teams for large-scale architectural changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience in backend systems&lt;/strong&gt; (8+ years) with exposure to large-scale, complex applications and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in Java (or a strong JVM background you can bring to a Java codebase)&lt;/strong&gt;, with a deep understanding of modern software engineering principles, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean Architecture, Domain-Driven Design (DDD), and Test-Driven Development (TDD)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced debugging and profiling techniques,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing composable, maintainable, and testable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spring or similar frameworks&lt;/strong&gt; with emphasis on building secure, modular, and scalable APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working knowledge of modern CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt; pipelines, containerization (Docker), and automated deployment workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong security mindset&lt;/strong&gt;, with practical knowledge of secure software design and common vulnerabilities (e.g., OWASP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with remote team collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;, i.e. tools and practices for asynchronous communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points for familiarity with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge graphs and GraphRAG: &lt;/strong&gt;building knowledge graphs and grounding LLMs with graph-based retrieval (e.g. neo4j-graphrag, LangChain, LlamaIndex)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graph algorithms and analytics: &lt;/strong&gt;(pathfinding, centrality, community detection) via Neo4j GDS, plus event-driven architectures, Kafka, or distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolving large graph data models: &lt;/strong&gt;over time: schema refactoring, migrations, and versioning as the domain grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud-native development: &lt;/strong&gt;observability, and performance tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Italy only:&lt;/strong&gt; The gross annual salary (RAL) range for this role when based in Italy is €60.000-€75.000. Salary is set individually for each candidate, based on objective, gender-neutral criteria such as experience, skills and scope of responsibility. Contract under the collective bargaining agreement (CCNL Metalmeccanici Industria). This information applies to Italy only. For other countries, please speak with the recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Neo4j?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is, without question, the most popular graph intelligence platform in the world. We have customers in every industry globally, and our products are a proven product/market fit. Joining our team is an opportunity to shape the future of data and analytics. Below are just a few exciting facts about Neo4j.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neo4j is one of the fastest-scaling technology companies in this industry. It &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/press-releases/neo4j-revenue-milestone-2024/&quot;&gt;recently surpassed $200M&lt;/a&gt; in annual recurring revenue (ARR), doubling its ARR &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/press-releases/2021-company-momentum/&quot;&gt;over the past three years.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raised the biggest funding round in database history ($325M Series F). Backed by world-class investors like Eurazeo, GV (formerly Google Ventures), and Inovia Capital, Neo4j has raised over $600M in funding and is currently valued at over $2Bn. This puts Neo4j among the most well-funded database companies in history.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;84% of the Fortune 100 and 58% of the Fortune 500 use Neo4j. Examples include &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/boston-scientific/&quot;&gt;Boston Scientific&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/bt/&quot;&gt;BT Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/caterpillar/&quot;&gt;Caterpillar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/cisco/&quot;&gt;Cisco&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/comcast/&quot;&gt;Comcast&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/department-for-education-uk/&quot;&gt;Department for Education UK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/ebay/&quot;&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/nbc-news/&quot;&gt;NBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/novo-nordisk/&quot;&gt;Novo Nordisk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/worldline/&quot;&gt;Worldline&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/&quot;&gt;others&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-founder and CEO Emil Eifrem has built an amazing culture that prides itself on relationships, inclusiveness, innovation, and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Countless &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/awards/&quot;&gt;industry awards&lt;/a&gt;. Massive enterprises and individual developers/data scientists love Neo4j. A strong sense of community and ecosystem is built around the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A recent Forrester Total Economic Impact™ Study cited Neo4j as delivering 417% ROI to customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bizjournals.com/bizwomen/news/profiles-strategies/2022/07/getting-the-job-how-gender-equity.html?page=all&quot;&gt;Research&lt;/a&gt; shows that members of underrepresented communities are less likely to apply for jobs when they don’t meet all the qualifications. &lt;strong&gt;If this is part of the reason you hesitate to apply, we’d encourage you to reconsider and give us the opportunity to review your application. &lt;/strong&gt;At Neo4j, we are committed to building awareness and helping to improve these issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our central objectives is to provide an inclusive, diverse, and equitable workplace for everyone to develop their potential and have a positive, career-defining experience. We look forward to receiving your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neo4j Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Neo4j is a Silicon Valley company with a Swedish soul. We foster collaboration and each of us is empowered to contribute and put our innovative stamp on projects. We hire candidates who reflect the following Neo4j core values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:VALUE]-&amp;gt;(relationships)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:FOCUS_ON]-&amp;gt;(userSuccess)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:THRIVE_IN]-&amp;gt;(:Culture {type: [‘Open’, ‘Inclusive’]})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:ASSUME]-&amp;gt;(:Intent {direction:’Positive’})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:WELCOME]-&amp;gt;(:Discussions {nature: ‘IntellectuallyHonest’})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:DELIVER_ON]-&amp;gt;(ourCommitments)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Neo4j is committed to protecting and respecting your privacy. Please read the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/privacy-policy/recruitment-process/?ref=hr-&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;privacy notice regarding Neo4j&#39;s recruitment process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to understand how we will handle the personal data that you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;More information at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.neo4j.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.neo4j.com&quot;&gt;www.neo4j.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;©2026 Neo4j, Inc., Neo Technology®, Neo4j®, Cypher®, Neo4j Bloom™, Neo4j Graph Data Science Library™, Neo4j® Aura™, and Neo4j® AuraDB™ are registered trademarks or a trademark of Neo4j, Inc. All other marks are owned by their respective companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Neo4j:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is the graph intelligence platform that transforms data into knowledge to power the next generation of intelligent applications and AI systems. It includes enterprise-ready knowledge graphs for accurate, explainable, and governed AI; the most comprehensive, trusted, and easy-to-deploy graph capabilities across any environment and data source; and an unmatched ecosystem trusted by 84 of the Fortune 100 and supported by the world’s largest graph community.&amp;nbsp;Intelligence that works. Results that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built to work everywhere and integrate with everything across every cloud for dynamic, personalized, and autonomous AI systems. We deliver quicker results, contextual knowledge, and solutions that impact customers and employees across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Neo4j, we have always strived to help the world make sense of data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As business, society and knowledge become increasingly connected, our technology promotes innovation by helping organizations to find and understand data relationships. We created, drive and lead the graph database category, and we’re disrupting how organizations leverage their data to innovate and stay competitive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;As our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Strategic Account Director – Australian Federal Government&lt;/strong&gt;, you will partner with senior executive leadership across Commonwealth departments and agencies to unlock the potential of connected data and sovereign AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;You will lead the engagement strategy across high-impact public sector initiatives—helping federal agencies harness the power of Neo4j technology to solve their most complex, data-centric operational challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Mission Areas &amp;amp; Use Cases You Will Champion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;This role is central to Neo4j’s growth strategy, building upon an established and rapidly growing footprint in the Australian Federal Government. You will work with agency leadership to deliver transformative graph solutions across key government priorities, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Citizen 360:&lt;/strong&gt; Enable a unified Citizen 360 view by connecting siloed data across departments, services, and systems to deliver proactive, personalised, and efficient service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sovereign AI &amp;amp; Context Layer:&lt;/strong&gt; Ground generative AI and Large Language Models (LLMs) with graph-powered context (GraphRAG) to eliminate hallucinations, ensure auditable lineage, and enable explainable decision-support in mission-critical policy environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Fraud Detection &amp;amp; Revenue Protection:&lt;/strong&gt; Expose organized fraud syndicates, circular transactions, and synthetic identities across taxation, customs, welfare, and public grant programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Aged Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect patient, provider, and clinical data across fragmented systems to improve care coordination, patient outcomes, population health insights, and data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;National Security &amp;amp; Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver real-time entity resolution, pattern-of-life analysis, and link analysis across disparate datasets to counter organized crime, foreign interference, and illicit financial flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Supply Chain Provenance &amp;amp; Defence Readiness:&lt;/strong&gt; Map Tier-N vendor networks, assess Foreign Ownership, Control, or Influence (FOCI) risks, and manage complex defence assets and Bill of Materials (BOM) logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cyber Threat Hunting &amp;amp; Zero Trust:&lt;/strong&gt; Map multi-cloud attack paths, privilege escalation risks, and lateral movement vectors to protect critical national infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Beneficial Ownership &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover opaque corporate ownership webs, shell company networks, and sanctions evasions (proven globally through investigations like the Panama Papers and FinCEN Files).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead Commonwealth Account Strategies:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and execute targeted account campaigns across priority Commonwealth portfolios, including Health and Aged Care, ATO, Services Australia, Home Affairs, NDIA, and Defence &amp;amp; National Security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Complex Sales Cycles:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute value-based, consultative sales strategies (MEDDPICC) engaging SES Band 1/2 leaders, Chief Information Officers, Chief Data Officers, and Chief AI Officers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Navigate Federal Procurement:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage Commonwealth panels and digital sourcing platforms (such as the DTA BuyICT Marketplace) alongside competitive tender responses (RFT/RFP) to secure high-value, multi-year software commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Land &amp;amp; Expand:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively prospect net-new agency logos while scaling existing production workloads across adjacent divisions, operational branches, and whole-of-government initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Ecosystem Partners:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-sell closely with sovereign cloud providers (AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud) and major Canberra-focused Defence/Federal Systems Integrators and advisory firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Orchestrate High-Performance Squads:&lt;/strong&gt; Mobilize internal Solutions Architecture, Pre-Sales, and Customer Success resources to deliver compelling Proofs of Value (POVs) aligned directly to agency mission outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Maintain Pipeline Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain disciplined pipeline hygiene, deal qualification, and predictable forecasting in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of enterprise software sales experience, with a documented track record of successfully selling complex data platforms, database technologies, advanced analytics, or cybersecurity solutions directly to the Australian Federal Government.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Track Record of Overachievement:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success consistently exceeding quota and closing enterprise software transactions ($1M+ ACV/TCV) within the Canberra public sector ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Public Sector Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Thorough understanding of Commonwealth Procurement Rules (CPRs), federal funding mechanisms (e.g., New Policy Proposals / NPP cycles), and sovereign data standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mission Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to articulate technical concepts—such as Graph Databases, Vector Search, Knowledge Graphs, and GraphRAG—in the context of agency mission outcomes (integrity, compliance, operational readiness, national security).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Methodology Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise using enterprise sales methodologies (e.g., MEDDPICC, Challenger) to navigate complex, consensus-driven federal buying groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Canberra Network:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep, pre-existing relationships with SES stakeholders, agency enterprise architects, and technical decision-makers across the Australian Public Service (APS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications &amp;amp; Security Clearances&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Security Clearance:&lt;/strong&gt; An active Australian Government security clearance (NV1 or NV2 strongly preferred; minimum Baseline) or eligibility and willingness to undergo the AGSVA vetting process (requires Australian citizenship).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Direct background selling modern distributed database systems, NoSQL, data fabrics, or enterprise AI/ML solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;Established channel and co-sell relationships across public cloud hyperscalers and Canberra Systems Integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Neo4j?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is, without question, the most popular graph intelligence platform in the world. We have customers in every industry globally, and our products are a proven product/market fit. Joining our team is an opportunity to shape the future of data and analytics. Below are just a few exciting facts about Neo4j.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neo4j is one of the fastest-scaling technology companies in this industry. It &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/press-releases/neo4j-revenue-milestone-2024/&quot;&gt;recently surpassed $200M&lt;/a&gt; in annual recurring revenue (ARR), doubling its ARR &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/press-releases/2021-company-momentum/&quot;&gt;over the past three years.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raised the biggest funding round in database history ($325M Series F). Backed by world-class investors like Eurazeo, GV (formerly Google Ventures), and Inovia Capital, Neo4j has raised over $600M in funding and is currently valued at over $2Bn. This puts Neo4j among the most well-funded database companies in history.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;84% of the Fortune 100 and 58% of the Fortune 500 use Neo4j. Examples include &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/boston-scientific/&quot;&gt;Boston Scientific&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/bt/&quot;&gt;BT Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/caterpillar/&quot;&gt;Caterpillar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/cisco/&quot;&gt;Cisco&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/comcast/&quot;&gt;Comcast&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/department-for-education-uk/&quot;&gt;Department for Education UK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/ebay/&quot;&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/nbc-news/&quot;&gt;NBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/novo-nordisk/&quot;&gt;Novo Nordisk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/worldline/&quot;&gt;Worldline&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/&quot;&gt;others&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-founder and CEO Emil Eifrem has built an amazing culture that prides itself on relationships, inclusiveness, innovation, and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Countless &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/awards/&quot;&gt;industry awards&lt;/a&gt;. Massive enterprises and individual developers/data scientists love Neo4j. A strong sense of community and ecosystem is built around the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A recent Forrester Total Economic Impact™ Study cited Neo4j as delivering 417% ROI to customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bizjournals.com/bizwomen/news/profiles-strategies/2022/07/getting-the-job-how-gender-equity.html?page=all&quot;&gt;Research&lt;/a&gt; shows that members of underrepresented communities are less likely to apply for jobs when they don’t meet all the qualifications. &lt;strong&gt;If this is part of the reason you hesitate to apply, we’d encourage you to reconsider and give us the opportunity to review your application. &lt;/strong&gt;At Neo4j, we are committed to building awareness and helping to improve these issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our central objectives is to provide an inclusive, diverse, and equitable workplace for everyone to develop their potential and have a positive, career-defining experience. We look forward to receiving your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neo4j Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Neo4j is a Silicon Valley company with a Swedish soul. We foster collaboration and each of us is empowered to contribute and put our innovative stamp on projects. We hire candidates who reflect the following Neo4j core values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:VALUE]-&amp;gt;(relationships)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:FOCUS_ON]-&amp;gt;(userSuccess)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:THRIVE_IN]-&amp;gt;(:Culture {type: [‘Open’, ‘Inclusive’]})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:ASSUME]-&amp;gt;(:Intent {direction:’Positive’})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:WELCOME]-&amp;gt;(:Discussions {nature: ‘IntellectuallyHonest’})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:DELIVER_ON]-&amp;gt;(ourCommitments)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
