&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate about, and collaborate on, complex topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of distributed systems through usage, administration or development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to learn modern and high performance Java programming (or prior knowledge).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to learn Kubernetes and building operators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to work as part of a geographically distributed team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
