&lt;p&gt;As a Developer on our team, you will sit at the intersection of our entire platform ecosystem. You will gain hands-on experience bridging cloud infrastructure, robust backend services, and user-facing client code. In this role, you will actively contribute to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Telemetry &amp;amp; User Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Building tools and metrics that give users clear insights into platform health and job execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Transfer &amp;amp; Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimizing pipelines for seamless data ingestion and streaming between client environments and our cloud backend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer UX Improvements:&lt;/strong&gt; Refining client interfaces and integration points to ensure our platform is intuitive, fast, and easy to adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to directly impact the tools our global customer base relies on every day, working alongside a supportive team that will help you sharpen your skills across the full technology stack.&lt;/p&gt;
