&lt;li&gt;Write new features that bridge the gap between on-premise and cloud solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Java, Go and Python code with a strong focus on usability, efficiency, and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on and improve the observability of our cloud systems&lt;/li&gt;
