&lt;li&gt;Clear writing. A large part of this job is skills, docs, and instructions that both humans and models follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in other developers’ pain points, especially people who are new to a platform, and the ability to design solutions that address those pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
