&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining AI skill files, agent instructions, MCP servers, or similar structured context for coding agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes-related developer tooling (Make, Kustomize, Helm) and with simplifying local workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating software with Google Cloud Platform, AWS, or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability: tracing, logging, and metrics — including for AI workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
