&lt;li&gt;7 years of experience in a pre-sales engineering, professional services, or customer-facing technical architecture role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in programming languages (e.g., Java, Python, JavaScript), containerization (Docker, Kubernetes), and cloud infrastructure technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
