&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Engineer, you will be a key driver of Neo4j’s growth by shaping technical solutions that address complex enterprise challenges. You will serve as the technical authority during the pre-sales lifecycle, moving beyond standard product demonstrations to architect robust, value-driven graph database solutions. You will engage deeply with BFSI &amp;amp; Enterprise customers and strategic partners—including hyperscalers like AWS, Azure, and Google Cloud—to design interconnected data ecosystems that prove the tangible ROI of the Neo4j portfolio. In this role, you will blend consultative technical prowess, sales acumen, and ecosystem collaboration to accelerate adoption and secure the technical win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is the world leader in graph technology, helping organizations capture real-world context to drive choices for applications like artificial intelligence, fraud detection, and recommendation engines. We deliver enterprise-grade solutions that leverage connection-first data architectures to solve the world&#39;s most critical business problems. Turn your technical expertise into impact by helping India’s largest enterprises unlock the value of AI with connected data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
