&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Neo4j, we have always strived to help the world make sense of data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As business, society and knowledge become increasingly connected, our technology promotes innovation by helping organizations to find and understand data relationships. We created, drive and lead the graph database category, and we’re disrupting how organizations leverage their data to innovate and stay competitive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive, &lt;/strong&gt;you will partner with executive leadership at top Indian organisations to unlock the power of data and AI using Neo4j’s industry-leading data intelligence platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Top Revenue Leaders Choose Neo4j&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Creator &amp;amp; Market Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; Backed by over $600M in funding ($325M Series F) at a $2B+ valuation, with $200M+ in ARR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ROI:&lt;/strong&gt; A recent Forrester Total Economic Impact™ study showed a &lt;strong&gt;417% ROI&lt;/strong&gt; for Neo4j customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Dominance:&lt;/strong&gt; Trusted by 84% of the Fortune 100, including premier global financial services providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI Wave:&lt;/strong&gt; Neo4j sits at the center of the next major enterprise shift: combining Knowledge Graphs with LLMs (GraphRAG) to eliminate AI hallucinations in mission-critical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow the India Market:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead strategic account planning and execution across a high-value portfolio of large enterprise customers alongside high-growth greenfield prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive High-Impact Sales Cycles:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute value-based, consultative sales strategies (MEDDPICC) across C-level, Line-of-Business, and Chief Data/AI Officer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Land &amp;amp; Expand:&lt;/strong&gt; Balance hunting new enterprise logos with driving workload expansion within established accounts—scaling adoption into new business units and high-value use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Cloud Ecosystems:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-sell and align strategic account plans with local hyperscaler ecosystems (AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud) and Global Systems Integrators (GSIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate High-Performance Squads:&lt;/strong&gt; Align internal Pre-Sales Engineering, Field Marketing, and Customer Success resources to qualify, scope, and deliver impactful Proofs of Value (POVs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Sales Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive predictable forecasting and pipeline hygiene within Salesforce.com.&lt;/li&gt;
