&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of enterprise software sales experience, with a direct focus on selling complex data platforms, cloud infrastructure, analytics, or enterprise software into the India market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record &lt;/strong&gt;of exceeding quotas and closing multi-year enterprise deals ($500k–$1M+ ACV) into major customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology mastery &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;amp; expertise in structured sales frameworks (MEDDPICC, Challenger, Command of the Message) navigating complex multi-stakeholder deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong existing relationships&lt;/strong&gt; across C-suite executives, enterprise data architects, and line-of-business owners across large enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
