&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is the graph intelligence platform that transforms data into knowledge to power the next generation of intelligent applications and AI systems. It includes enterprise-ready knowledge graphs for accurate, explainable, and governed AI; the most comprehensive, trusted, and easy-to-deploy graph capabilities across any environment and data source; and an unmatched ecosystem trusted by 84 of the Fortune 100 and supported by the world’s largest graph community.&amp;nbsp;Intelligence that works. Results that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built to work everywhere and integrate with everything across every cloud for dynamic, personalized, and autonomous AI systems. We deliver quicker results, contextual knowledge, and solutions that impact customers and employees across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Neo4j, we have always strived to help the world make sense of data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As business, society and knowledge become increasingly connected, our technology promotes innovation by helping organizations to find and understand data relationships. We created, drive and lead the graph database category, and we’re disrupting how organizations leverage their data to innovate and stay competitive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bangalore, India (Hybrid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Account Executive, Digital Natives&lt;/strong&gt;, you will partner with executive and engineering leadership at high-growth digital native companies, unicorns, and scale-ups across India to unlock the power of data and AI using Neo4j’s industry-leading data intelligence platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Top Revenue Leaders Choose Neo4j&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI Wave:&lt;/strong&gt; Neo4j sits at the center of the next major enterprise shift: combining Knowledge Graphs with LLMs (GraphRAG) to eliminate AI hallucinations in mission-critical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Creator &amp;amp; Market Leader:&lt;/strong&gt; Backed by over 600M in funding (325M Series F) at a $2B+ valuation, with $200M+ in ARR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ROI:&lt;/strong&gt; A recent Forrester Total Economic Impact™ study showed a 417% ROI for Neo4j customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Dominance:&lt;/strong&gt; Trusted by 84% of the Fortune 100 alongside the fastest-growing tech disruptors and digital native giants worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate the Digital Native Segment:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead strategic territory planning and aggressive pipeline execution across India’s premier digital native organisations, technology unicorns, and venture-backed scale-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Velocity &amp;amp; High-Impact Sales Cycles:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute agile, value-based consultative sales strategies (MEDDPICC) tailored to fast-paced Tech Founders, CTOs, Chief Data/AI Officers, and VP/Directors of Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Land &amp;amp; Scale Rapidly:&lt;/strong&gt; Acquire high-growth digital native logos and rapidly expand workloads, driving product adoption into new engineering pods and AI/analytics initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage Cloud Ecosystems:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-sell and align strategic deal plans with cloud partners (AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud) to capitalize on digital native cloud spend and marketplace acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate High-Performance Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with Pre-Sales/Solutions Engineering, Developer Relations, Field Marketing, and Customer Success to run rapid, impactful Proofs of Concept (POCs) and tech evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Pipeline Discipline:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive predictable forecasting, deal velocity, and pipeline hygiene within Salesforce.com.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location Requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Based in Bangalore, India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years of direct software sales experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong track record selling cloud database platforms, developer tools, SaaS, or data/analytics infrastructure to high-growth tech or digital native companies in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistent history of exceeding quotas, managing high-velocity deal cycles, and expanding annual contract values (ACVs) in competitive environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in structured sales frameworks (MEDDPICC, Command of the Message) adapted for fast-moving product and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech-Forward Network:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong existing relationships with engineering leaders, data architects, and C-level tech executives across the local digital native and startup ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of modern developer ecosystems, cloud-native database platforms, distributed systems, or AI/ML technologies (e.g., LLMs, vector search, graph analytics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience co-selling via public cloud marketplaces (AWS Marketplace, Azure Marketplace, GCP Marketplace).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, high-agility sales motion while building long-term account value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to customer sites, industry events, and internal business meetings as required.&lt;/li&gt;
