&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Neo4j is committed to protecting and respecting your privacy. Please read the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/privacy-policy/recruitment-process/?ref=hr-&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;privacy notice regarding Neo4j&#39;s recruitment process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to understand how we will handle the personal data that you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;More information at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.neo4j.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.neo4j.com&quot;&gt;www.neo4j.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;©2026 Neo4j, Inc., Neo Technology®, Neo4j®, Cypher®, Neo4j Bloom™, Neo4j Graph Data Science Library™, Neo4j® Aura™, and Neo4j® AuraDB™ are registered trademarks or a trademark of Neo4j, Inc. All other marks are owned by their respective companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Neo4j:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is the graph intelligence platform that transforms data into knowledge to power the next generation of intelligent applications and AI systems. It includes enterprise-ready knowledge graphs for accurate, explainable, and governed AI; the most comprehensive, trusted, and easy-to-deploy graph capabilities across any environment and data source; and an unmatched ecosystem trusted by 84 of the Fortune 100 and supported by the world’s largest graph community.&amp;nbsp;Intelligence that works. Results that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built to work everywhere and integrate with everything across every cloud for dynamic, personalized, and autonomous AI systems. We deliver quicker results, contextual knowledge, and solutions that impact customers and employees across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Neo4j, we have always strived to help the world make sense of data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As business, society and knowledge become increasingly connected, our technology promotes innovation by helping organizations to find and understand data relationships. We created, drive and lead the graph database category, and we’re disrupting how organizations leverage their data to innovate and stay competitive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Product Marketing Manager - GraphAware Solutions&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK, Czechia or Spain (Remote, with some travel)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Marketing Director, Neo4j GraphAware&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why apply?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Neo4j GraphAware, we help organisations make sense of complex data to uncover hidden relationships, investigate risk, and make better decisions. Our solutions support customers tackling some of the most demanding challenges in financial crime, intelligence analysis, and other mission-critical environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Following GraphAware&#39;s acquisition by Neo4j, we&#39;re entering an exciting new phase of growth. Combining GraphAware&#39;s specialist technology and industry expertise with Neo4j&#39;s global reach creates a significant opportunity to bring our solutions to new customers and markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to help shape how we position, communicate, and bring these solutions to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Solutions Marketing Manager, you&#39;ll be responsible for understanding our customers, markets, and technology, and turning that knowledge into compelling positioning, messaging, and sales enablement assets that help us win business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a product marketing role focused on &lt;strong&gt;industry solutions rather than individual products&lt;/strong&gt;. Your initial focus will be on our Financial Crime Intelligence solution, helping financial institutions detect complex risks and investigate financial crime. Over time, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to work across other solutions, industries, and customer segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll combine strategic thinking with hands-on execution, whether that&#39;s developing a new value proposition, equipping sellers for customer conversations, or shaping the messaging for a go-to-market campaign.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;editor-list-ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer and market understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop an understanding of our target industries, customers, and use cases. Research customer challenges, industry trends, and buying behaviors to identify target segments, develop ideal customer profiles and buyer personas, and inform our go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positioning and messaging:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the positioning and messaging for our solutions, translating complex technical capabilities into clear customer value propositions. Develop messaging frameworks, use-case narratives, proof points, and persona-specific messaging, ensuring consistency across sales materials, campaigns, web pages, and other customer touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip our sales teams with the knowledge and assets they need to identify opportunities, engage prospects, and win business. Develop pitch decks, solution overviews, discovery and qualification guides, objection handling, competitive battle-cards, and demo narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive intelligence and customer evidence:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Neo4j&#39;s competitive intelligence function to develop clear differentiation and practical field guidance. Collaborate with Sales, Customer Advocacy, and Content teams to identify and develop compelling customer stories and proof points that demonstrate our value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-market campaigns and launches:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape solution launches and marketing campaigns by defining target audiences, customer challenges, messaging, value propositions, and content requirements. Partner with Demand Generation, Content, and Regional Marketing teams to ensure campaigns resonate with customers and support our commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought leadership and solution content: &lt;/strong&gt;Develop compelling points of view on industry challenges, market trends, and emerging technologies that establish our expertise and differentiate our approach. Research and draft thought leadership articles, positioning content, and other written materials, working with our Solutions Content Writer to refine and publish them. Help shape the messaging and content of our solution landing pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile we have in mind&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a commercially-minded marketer who enjoys understanding complex technology and finding ways to communicate value clearly. You should be equally comfortable developing a positioning strategy, collaborating with technical specialists, and helping a salesperson prepare for an important customer conversation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential background &amp;amp; experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;editor-list-ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2B technology marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience in B2B technology marketing, including at least 3 years in product marketing, solutions marketing, or a closely related role. Ideally, you&#39;ll have worked with enterprise software, financial services technology, data platforms, analytics, or similarly complex solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positioning and messaging:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience translating complex technical capabilities and customer challenges into clear, compelling, and differentiated value propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of creating practical sales materials and enablement resources that help commercial teams engage customers and win business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; A good understanding of enterprise sales cycles, buying groups, customer decision-making, and how marketing can influence pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market and competitive research:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to research customers, industries, competitors, and emerging trends, and translate your findings into actionable marketing and commercial recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent writing and verbal communication skills. You can simplify complex topics, ask good questions, and communicate your ideas clearly to different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills &amp;amp; attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;editor-list-ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity, adaptability, and continuous improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;You enjoy learning about unfamiliar industries, getting to grips with new technologies, and finding better ways of working. You&#39;re confident experimenting with AI tools and automation to improve your productivity and the effectiveness of the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic thinking with hands-on execution:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable thinking about the bigger picture, but equally happy rolling up your sleeves to create a pitch deck, refine a message, or solve a practical problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and independence:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re proactive, organised, and comfortable managing competing priorities, making informed decisions, and driving work forward with autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration and influence:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re a team player who can build productive relationships across functions and geographies, influence without direct authority, and bring people together around a shared objective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;editor-list-ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience marketing technology solutions to financial crime, fraud, AML, compliance, or risk management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Experience with public sector, government, defence, or law enforcement markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Familiarity with enterprise data technologies, graph databases, advanced analytics, or AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Familiarity with common marketing and sales platforms, such as Salesforce, Marketo, WordPress, web analytics tools, and sales intelligence platforms like Gong. Experience with equivalent tools is equally welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;editor-list-ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-impact role:&lt;/strong&gt; Help shape the go-to-market strategy for a growing portfolio of industry solutions, with the backing and reach of Neo4j.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for your areas of work, influence strategic decisions, and have the freedom to turn ideas into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interesting challenges:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with advanced technology and customers solving complex, meaningful problems across financial crime, intelligence analysis, and other mission-critical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;editor-listitem&quot; value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative international team:&lt;/strong&gt; Work alongside experienced colleagues across Product, Sales, Marketing, and Engineering in a supportive, highly collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Neo4j?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is, without question, the most popular graph intelligence platform in the world. We have customers in every industry globally, and our products are a proven product/market fit. Joining our team is an opportunity to shape the future of data and analytics. Below are just a few exciting facts about Neo4j.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neo4j is one of the fastest-scaling technology companies in this industry. It &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/press-releases/neo4j-revenue-milestone-2024/&quot;&gt;recently surpassed $200M&lt;/a&gt; in annual recurring revenue (ARR), doubling its ARR &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/press-releases/2021-company-momentum/&quot;&gt;over the past three years.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raised the biggest funding round in database history ($325M Series F). Backed by world-class investors like Eurazeo, GV (formerly Google Ventures), and Inovia Capital, Neo4j has raised over $600M in funding and is currently valued at over $2Bn. This puts Neo4j among the most well-funded database companies in history.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;84% of the Fortune 100 and 58% of the Fortune 500 use Neo4j. Examples include &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/boston-scientific/&quot;&gt;Boston Scientific&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/bt/&quot;&gt;BT Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/caterpillar/&quot;&gt;Caterpillar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/cisco/&quot;&gt;Cisco&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/comcast/&quot;&gt;Comcast&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/department-for-education-uk/&quot;&gt;Department for Education UK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/ebay/&quot;&gt;eBay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/nbc-news/&quot;&gt;NBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/novo-nordisk/&quot;&gt;Novo Nordisk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/worldline/&quot;&gt;Worldline&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/case-studies/&quot;&gt;others&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-founder and CEO Emil Eifrem has built an amazing culture that prides itself on relationships, inclusiveness, innovation, and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Countless &lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/awards/&quot;&gt;industry awards&lt;/a&gt;. Massive enterprises and individual developers/data scientists love Neo4j. A strong sense of community and ecosystem is built around the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A recent Forrester Total Economic Impact™ Study cited Neo4j as delivering 417% ROI to customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bizjournals.com/bizwomen/news/profiles-strategies/2022/07/getting-the-job-how-gender-equity.html?page=all&quot;&gt;Research&lt;/a&gt; shows that members of underrepresented communities are less likely to apply for jobs when they don’t meet all the qualifications. &lt;strong&gt;If this is part of the reason you hesitate to apply, we’d encourage you to reconsider and give us the opportunity to review your application. &lt;/strong&gt;At Neo4j, we are committed to building awareness and helping to improve these issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our central objectives is to provide an inclusive, diverse, and equitable workplace for everyone to develop their potential and have a positive, career-defining experience. We look forward to receiving your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neo4j Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Neo4j is a Silicon Valley company with a Swedish soul. We foster collaboration and each of us is empowered to contribute and put our innovative stamp on projects. We hire candidates who reflect the following Neo4j core values:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:VALUE]-&amp;gt;(relationships)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:FOCUS_ON]-&amp;gt;(userSuccess)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:THRIVE_IN]-&amp;gt;(:Culture {type: [‘Open’, ‘Inclusive’]})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:ASSUME]-&amp;gt;(:Intent {direction:’Positive’})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:WELCOME]-&amp;gt;(:Discussions {nature: ‘IntellectuallyHonest’})&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(we)-[:DELIVER_ON]-&amp;gt;(ourCommitments)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Neo4j is committed to protecting and respecting your privacy. Please read the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://neo4j.com/privacy-policy/recruitment-process/?ref=hr-&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;privacy notice regarding Neo4j&#39;s recruitment process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to understand how we will handle the personal data that you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;More information at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.neo4j.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.neo4j.com&quot;&gt;www.neo4j.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;©2026 Neo4j, Inc., Neo Technology®, Neo4j®, Cypher®, Neo4j Bloom™, Neo4j Graph Data Science Library™, Neo4j® Aura™, and Neo4j® AuraDB™ are registered trademarks or a trademark of Neo4j, Inc. All other marks are owned by their respective companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Neo4j:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neo4j is the graph intelligence platform that transforms data into knowledge to power the next generation of intelligent applications and AI systems. It includes enterprise-ready knowledge graphs for accurate, explainable, and governed AI; the most comprehensive, trusted, and easy-to-deploy graph capabilities across any environment and data source; and an unmatched ecosystem trusted by 84 of the Fortune 100 and supported by the world’s largest graph community.&amp;nbsp;Intelligence that works. Results that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built to work everywhere and integrate with everything across every cloud for dynamic, personalized, and autonomous AI systems. We deliver quicker results, contextual knowledge, and solutions that impact customers and employees across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Vision:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Neo4j, we have always strived to help the world make sense of data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As business, society and knowledge become increasingly connected, our technology promotes innovation by helping organizations to find and understand data relationships. We created, drive and lead the graph database category, and we’re disrupting how organizations leverage their data to innovate and stay competitive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; Principal AI Solutions Architect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Principal AI Solutions Architect, you will lead the design, construction, and deployment of AI solutions that combine the power of graph databases and AI. You will act as a trusted advisor to our strategic customers, guiding them through complex data challenges and delivering transformative business value. You will have a great understanding of graph technologies, LLMs, and AI frameworks, and will be able to translate customer needs into production-ready AI applications grounded in real-world context using Neo4j Knowledge Graphs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solution Architecting:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will engage with technical leaders, stakeholders, and strategic partners to shape and guide the successful implementation of Graph+GenAI solutions, serving as a trusted advisor and thought partner to decision-makers throughout complex, high-impact engagements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will design and advocate for robust, scalable solution architectures, leading the deployment of Graph+GenAI systems aligned with complex enterprise requirements and industry best practices driving architectural excellence and long-term value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will collaborate closely with customer leadership to deeply understand their strategic objectives, translating them into high-impact AI solutions that harness the synergy of graph databases and LLMs. This includes leading the discovery of requirements, assessing enterprise data ecosystems, and identifying innovative opportunities to apply graph-based AI at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will lead stakeholder engagement across all levels to steer project scope, align on priorities, mitigate risks, and ensure timely delivery—ensuring alignment between technical execution and business outcomes while maintaining a focus on measurable impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solution Engineering:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will develop, test, and deploy production-ready AI applications that integrate graph databases with LLMs and orchestration frameworks. This involves writing production-level code, optimizing for performance and scalability, and ensuring seamless integration with customer systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Continuously evaluate and improve the performance, scalability, and efficiency of deployed AI applications, incorporating new techniques and technologies as they emerge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
