&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are aiming to hire someone in the the UK, Czechia or&amp;nbsp;Italy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a visionary and hands-on Tech Lead for AI to shape and build the artificial intelligence capabilities of Hume, our connected data analytics platform, from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The initial focus will be Hume Maestro, our core AI component. You will be the architect and the builder, designing the foundations of our AI layer while actively contributing to its development. You will translate product vision into sound technical decisions, ensuring high-quality delivery within a collaborative, shared decision-making framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Design the foundations and technical roadmap of the AI layer within the Hume platform, specifically focusing on Hume Maestro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively contribute to the codebase, setting the standard for technical excellence, performance, and scalability in our AI components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Work within a shared decision-making structure alongside Product Managers and our Chief Scientist to align technical execution with product vision and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the broader Hume team (including front-end and platform engineers) to ensure seamless integration of AI capabilities into the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices in AI/ML engineering, including model evaluation, deployment pipelines, and maintainable code structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Future Team Building:&lt;/strong&gt; As the AI function expands, you will have the opportunity to transition from an individual contributor/lead role into building and mentoring a dedicated AI engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
