&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record as a Senior or Lead Engineer with deep expertise in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience in designing and deploying AI architectures, with a focus on LLMs, graph-based AI, or complex data processing layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to bridge the gap between high-level research/vision and production-ready engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working closely with Product and Science stakeholders to balance technical debt, innovation, and delivery speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Potential:&lt;/strong&gt; A desire to eventually lead and inspire a team, with the communication skills necessary to coordinate complex technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in B2B SaaS or high-growth deep-tech environments is highly preferred.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Italy only:&lt;/strong&gt; The gross annual salary (RAL) range for this role when based in Italy is €60.000-€75.000. Salary is set individually for each candidate, based on objective, gender-neutral criteria such as experience, skills and scope of responsibility. Contract under the collective bargaining agreement (CCNL Metalmeccanici Industria). This information applies to Italy only. For other countries, please speak with the recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Neo4j?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
