&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;DeepIntent is the leading healthcare marketing platform, purpose-built to help marketers plan, activate, and optimize data-driven campaigns with speed and precision. Trusted by the world’s top healthcare brands and their agencies, DeepIntent uniquely unites media, identity, and real-world clinical data to power privacy-safe, omnichannel marketing across every screen. Backed by patented technology and proven outcomes, DeepIntent’s platform delivers measurable audience quality and script lift at scale. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deepintent.com&quot;&gt;www.deepintent.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About the Delivery Amplification Office:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Delivery Amplification Office (DAO) is not a traditional PMO. We are an AI-native delivery function that makes engineering faster, clearer and easier to steer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We run on the following two foundations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplified Squads&lt;/strong&gt; is our AI-native operating model. Small, goal-aligned squads with AI built into how they plan, track, report and ship. Agents and automation handle intake, hygiene and status, so people spend their time on decisions and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Delivery Intelligence Platform&lt;/strong&gt; is the centre of everything we do. It is an always-on layer across Jira, Confluence, Slack and our people systems that turns delivery activity into live signal: squad health, risk, throughput, release status and executive briefs. Every squad, epic, release and report flows through it — and Delivery Operations keeps it true.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Delivery Operations Manager owns the operating system of one or more Business Lines (BLs): the data, cadence, tooling and automation that Amplified Squads run on. Paired with a Senior Delivery Lead as daily working partner and growth-path mentor, you move from keeping the system accurate to redesigning it — on a deliberate path toward Delivery Lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating Model Stewardship&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Amplified Squads health for 1–2 BLs: lifecycle adherence, goal coverage, squad lifespan and dissolution postponements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and enforce operating conventions (naming, release versions, mandatory fields, dissolution checks), and document them in the DAO playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn squad retrospectives and survey data into concrete changes to how squads form, run and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Intelligence Platform Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the operations voice of the platform: define business logic, data-quality rules and acceptance criteria, and run UAT with the Delivery Engineers who build it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption so squads, EMs and PMs work from the platform, not from side spreadsheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn its signals into early warnings that reach your Delivery Lead before a review does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation and AI Agents&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the ops automation backlog for your BLs: every recurring task with its frequency, effort and automation path (Jira rule, platform capability or AI agent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship at least one automation per quarter that retires a recurring manual task, and report the hours returned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and tune AI delivery agents for hygiene, summarisation and follow-up, with clear checks on their accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute proven patterns to the DAO&#39;s Agentic Framework for cross-BL adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting and Delivery Insights&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the quantitative layer of executive reporting and recurring delivery briefs for your BLs, reconciled to source.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft the first qualitative read — what moved, why, and what&#39;s at risk — for your Senior Delivery Lead to sharpen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the metrics the operating model is judged on: throughput, cycle time, WIP and goal coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling and Workflow Governance&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Jira configuration standards across your BLs: workflows, issue types, fields and boards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess the impact of every workflow change request, align stakeholders on edge cases, and roll changes out without breaking reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DAO-wide Ops Domain&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own one operations domain for the whole DAO, such as release and change management, cadence design, or the reporting data layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the standard other Delivery Operations follow in that domain, and spot-check their output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement and Team Leverage&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the playbooks and onboarding that teach teams the Amplified Squads model and our tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and coach the work of Delivery Operations peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work against explicit Lead-readiness milestones agreed with your Senior Delivery Lead: run a BL review solo, lead a stakeholder alignment, own an escalation end to end with a recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as Delivery Lead backup for your BL during leave or peak load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in delivery operations, PMO, program coordination or Atlassian administration in a fast-moving technology company, including 1+ year owning operations for a team or BL rather than executing tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in Jira: advanced JQL, dashboards, workflow and automation rules, and how field and screen configuration drive data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven automator: you have retired a manual process with Jira automation, scripts or AI, and can say how many hours it returned.&lt;/li&gt;
