&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the Enterprise – G&amp;amp;A Analytics Engineering roadmap, prioritizing pipelines, models, semantic layer work, and data products based on business impact and stakeholder needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
