&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience using AI tools for analytics development and delivery, such as Claude Code, Snowflake Intelligence, or similar technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience building or improving a semantic layer, metrics governance process, or shared metric definitions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with BI or analytics tools such as Tableau or Hex and a clear understanding of what makes data products easy to use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience helping non-technical stakeholders use data with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A track record of building or strengthening collaborative teams that deliver strong outcomes together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Enthusiasm for building a collaborative, engaging, and results-oriented team culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience supporting Finance or executive reporting, familiarity with SaaS revenue metrics, and experience improving analytics engineering practices during periods of scale or organizational change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
