&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist, Forward Deployed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forward Deployed Engineering · Predictive track · Senior&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Forward Deployed Engineering (FDE), Predictive track, in Data Science &amp;amp; AI Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REPORTS TO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Director of Data Science&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LEVEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Senior (5+ years) — the team&#39;s lead modeler&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LOCATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;United States&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE IN ONE PARAGRAPH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Data Scientist to be the team&#39;s lead modeler. You&#39;ll work hands-on with our strategic customers&#39; data to tailor, retrain and validate the models that tell their sales and marketing teams which accounts and buyers to focus on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll usually drive two or three customer engagements at once, each on real production data, and present the results in terms of business value. The best of your work becomes a standard capability for every 6sense customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build for the customer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to know each customer&#39;s go-to-market and data, from CRM and marketing automation to firmographic and intent signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retrain and tune account and contact models: ideal customer profile and industry definitions, keyword strategy, how CRM activity feeds the models, feature selection, and the balance of first- and third-party signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prove impact with backtests against the live model and, where possible, the customer&#39;s own scoring, using opportunity conversion by score bucket.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calibrate score thresholds and scaling so customers get a steady, explainable flow of qualified accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer-ready deliverables: review decks, explainability views, score files and documentation customers can verify.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the team&#39;s MLOps engineer to bring solutions into production so they keep delivering after handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Productize for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture what you learn as reusable patterns, and share recurring needs with Product, backed by field evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Required: 6-8 years building and deploying machine learning models in production, ideally ranking, propensity, classification or scoring models on tabular or behavioral data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in machine learning and applied statistics, including tree-based models such as XGBoost and Random Forest, model evaluation and calibration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Python and SQL, with experience on large, messy, real-world datasets, including matching customer CRM records to account data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or for customers on their data: consulting, client-site work, or a forward-deployed, solutions or customer-facing data role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable switching between several ad hoc projects in a week rather than one long roadmap item.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to explain technical work clearly to non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product mindset: you look for the solution that works for the next ten customers, not just this one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: B2B go-to-market data (CRM, marketing automation, intent, ABM or predictive scoring); lead or contact scoring models; model explainability methods such as feature importance or SHAP; Spark, SingleStore or Hive on AWS; LLM-based tools, agents or evaluation methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 3 months: you&#39;ve delivered tailored models for at least two customer engagements, each with before-and-after results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 6 months: at least one of your solutions is reusable across customers and on its way into the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In 12 months: you&#39;re the team&#39;s go-to expert on model tuning and validation, and your playbooks make each new engagement faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role is different:&lt;/strong&gt; you work on real customer data with real stakes, see the results in the customer&#39;s pipeline, and your best work becomes a capability every 6sense customer uses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
