&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate how advertising, audience activation, predictive intelligence, and intent data contribute to pipeline and revenue outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred experience includes selling into large enterprise organizations and engaging executive marketing stakeholders such as CMOs, VP Marketing, VP Advertising, VP Media, Demand Generation and ABM Leaders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Candidate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ideal candidate has successfully sold B2B programmatic advertising that includes audience targeting, predictive intelligence, intent data, AI-driven marketing into large enterprise organizations and understands how advertising fits within a broader B2B go-to-market strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This individual has experience engaging executive-level marketing buyers and can connect advertising investments directly to pipeline creation, revenue growth, account engagement, and measurable business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have a proven track record of expanding complex enterprise organizations by identifying new buying centers, building executive relationships, navigating matrixed stakeholders, and increasing share of wallet across large accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
