&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To sustain and nurture solid relationships with key clients that generate the most income for Razorpay.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roles and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Building and maintaining relationships with clients and key personnel within their company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
