&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own and manage end-to-end strategic bank partnerships, driving long-term value and alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive revenue growth by enabling and scaling sales through bank channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the end-to-end rollout of banking programs, ensuring seamless execution and adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Position Razorpay POS as the preferred partner for banks’ merchant acquiring business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build and nurture strong, multi-level stakeholder relationships, particularly with product, business, and decision-making teams within partner banks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead RFP preparation, submission, and end-to-end coordination with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive cross-functional collaboration across internal teams to deliver on partner objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Travel regularly to engage with bank and NBFC partners and strengthen on-ground relationships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mandatory Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;10–12 years of experience, preferably in a bank’s merchant acquiring or payments business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience in banking partnerships, alliances, or channel sales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in RFP preparation is an added advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to influence senior stakeholders and drive alignment across cross-functional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AI &amp;amp; Digital Competency :&amp;nbsp;Practical experience using LLMs like ChatGPT or Claude.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Process Automation :&amp;nbsp;Ability to identify manual bottlenecks and apply AI or automation tools to improve efficiency, scale operations, and speed up go-to-market&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AI tools and the ability to leverage them to improve partner engagement, enhance outcomes, and drive overall quality and efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
